{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26703","headline":"寄旧山隐者 · 姚合","name":"寄旧山隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别君须臾间，历日两度新。\n念彼白日长，复值人事并。\n未改当时居，心事如野云。\n朝朝恣行坐，百事都不闻。\n奈何道未尽，出山最艰辛。\n奔走衢路间，四枝不属身。\n名在进士场，笔毫争等伦。\n我性本朴直，词理安得文。\n纵然自称心，又不合衆人。\n以此名字低，不如风中尘。\n昨逢卖药客，云是居山邻。\n说君忆我心，顦顇其形神。\n昔是同枝鸟，今作万里分。\n万里亦未遥，喧静终难羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}